	Nethack movement

	One thing I find annoying though livable with is the distinction
	between walking and running - I just want to be able to move
	fast to make the game interesting not because my character wants
	to go fast - so I don't like the fact that I'm told my character
	has bumped in to a door if its a bit clumsy!

	Something I'd like is to be able to push things about - you can
	push boulders and you can kick things but what about simply
	shoving things, where I assume a shove will move the object one
	square at a time at most.  I've often wanted this when I've been
	dumping found armour and weapons onto altars and cannot pick
	them all up and do not like to kick them off (or I want them all
	in one place so I can zap them).

	Merry Hacking!

	Caroline


